{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/8240c32bd40766c2b9eebe84ac7c94a6.poster.avif?t=1756445594\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/8240c32bd40766c2b9eebe84ac7c94a6.webm?t=1756445594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/8240c32bd40766c2b9eebe84ac7c94a6.mp4?t=1756445594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Explore</strong> an world years after humans have died out. Playing as a <strong>Morphite</strong>, new resin based lifeforms, venture out from the safety of your Cradle into a wild <strong>hazardous levels</strong> to <strong>collect rubbish resources</strong>.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/aab9592ca1e1ac520e403525dfb660a2.webp?t=1756445594\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/5c23bbc52133f95aead858ee27bcb6af.poster.avif?t=1756445594\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/5c23bbc52133f95aead858ee27bcb6af.webm?t=1756445594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/5c23bbc52133f95aead858ee27bcb6af.mp4?t=1756445594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Craft &amp; Attach Forms</strong> to <strong>gain abilities</strong> that help you; explore, survive hazards, avoid creatures, help other players &amp; collect resources. Players can attach up to 4 forms at once.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/aab9592ca1e1ac520e403525dfb660a2.webp?t=1756445594\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/d7d44e964369a528ca577bb0d5221ac9.poster.avif?t=1756445594\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/d7d44e964369a528ca577bb0d5221ac9.webm?t=1756445594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/d7d44e964369a528ca577bb0d5221ac9.mp4?t=1756445594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Each level contains a different <strong>procedurally generated Hazard Dungeon</strong>, ensuring high replayability. Their level locations are fixed, while the puzzles, layout and hazards within are generated.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/aab9592ca1e1ac520e403525dfb660a2.webp?t=1756445594\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/6f18f3fddf2758f0a57a6636e255d9bc.poster.avif?t=1756445594\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/6f18f3fddf2758f0a57a6636e255d9bc.webm?t=1756445594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/6f18f3fddf2758f0a57a6636e255d9bc.mp4?t=1756445594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The world consists of a series of 7 levels, each with hazards preventing resin life from flourishing. Help <strong>spread the influence of The Nexus</strong> (resin hive-mind) by solving Hazard Dungeons to remove these hazards while <strong>uncovering</strong> the story behind <strong>humanity\u2019s ruin</strong> and the <strong>origins of resin life</strong>.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1589700?t=1756445594","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1589700?t=1756445594","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/53b2523d39443ef741794f1394d40ee703b26f44/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756445594","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/53b2523d39443ef741794f1394d40ee703b26f44/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756445594","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/8240c32bd40766c2b9eebe84ac7c94a6.poster.avif?t=1756445594\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/8240c32bd40766c2b9eebe84ac7c94a6.webm?t=1756445594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/8240c32bd40766c2b9eebe84ac7c94a6.mp4?t=1756445594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Explore</strong> an world years after humans have died out. Playing as a <strong>M